      "repository": "gordolio/Trio",
      "number": 1449,
      "title": "Fix non-atomic append in the log file writer",
      "body": "SimpleLogReporter seeks to end-of-file and then writes, so anything appended between the two is overwritten. Harmless while it is the only writer of logs/log.txt, but pump manager plugins run in-process and loggerLock does not cover them. O_APPEND plus a single write(2) makes it atomic. appendToWatchLog uses the same extension.",
      "labels": [],
      "url": "https://github.com/nightscout/Trio/pull/1449",
